# Build context is the PARENT dir (contains katago-ws, katago-rs, muxa, pgmq).
# Ignore everything, then re-include only the four repos we build from, minus
# their heavy build/VCS artifacts.
*

!katago-ws
!katago-rs
!muxa
!pgmq

**/target
**/.git
**/*.log
**/analysis_logs
# katago-ws: the local bench corpus, models and KataGo builds (gitignored).
katago-ws/bench
# katago-rs: only its crates, third_party and tools/bin2onnx are built from;
# the nets are converted in the image (Dockerfile `nets` stage).
katago-rs/.venv
katago-rs/build
katago-rs/models
katago-rs/packages
katago-rs/upstream
katago-rs/fixtures
katago-rs/crates/katago-web-bench/www
